/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A Variant data type is a flexible and dynamic data type that can hold different types of data within a single column or field, such as integers, strings, arrays, JSON, or other semi-structured formats. This is particularly useful for working with semi-structured data like JSON, XML, Avro, or Parquet, where the schema or structure of the data may vary or be nested.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
